      {
        "ref": "1CH 6:28",
        "text": "The sons of Samuel: the firstborn, Joel, and the second, Abijah.",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH06.htm#V28",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceSHA256": "d78172e354b89594013770fdd58a95a3b6f6601364e3adcf5a1ce0fdce4aa9b9"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1CH 6:33",
        "text": "These are those who served, and their sons. Of the sons of the Kohathites: Heman the singer, the son of Joel, the son of Samuel,",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH06.htm#V33",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceSHA256": "3ee077fa069b82d24b16a9abd99fd6509175ec9001aaf46407d9f305f1ea664b"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1CH 9:22",
        "text": "All these who were chosen to be gatekeepers in the thresholds were two hundred twelve. These were listed by genealogy in their villages, whom David and Samuel the seer ordained in their office of trust.",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH09.htm#V22",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceSHA256": "8fe6f2ab67c881cf3ccb0988721476a20adeabccad858d14b89ec55610b40140"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1CH 11:3",
        "text": "So all the elders of Israel came to the king to Hebron; and David made a covenant with them in Hebron before the LORD. They anointed David king over Israel, according to the LORD’s word by Samuel.",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH11.htm#V3",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceSHA256": "b57b8fd05c02312edadd5df9e9b262da978f36d4b5fa12195d612f3bac46b234"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1CH 26:28",
        "text": "All that Samuel the seer, Saul the son of Kish, Abner the son of Ner, and Joab the son of Zeruiah had dedicated, whoever had dedicated anything, it was under the hand of Shelomoth and of his brothers.",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH26.htm#V28",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceSHA256": "6b2e10ace1e4e25e34b43bb5a8b23ceb6d1f9c260073a3c199b4d1f8905f4bd6"
      },
      {
        "ref": "1CH 29:29",
        "text": "Now the acts of David the king, first and last, behold, they are written in the history of Samuel the seer, and in the history of Nathan the prophet, and in the history of Gad the seer,",
